  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "在实际计算时，函数 $y=10^x$ 起着重要的作用。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 210,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0217#5"
      ],
      "source_text": "在实际计算时，函数 $y=10^x$ 起着重要的作用.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们作出这个函数在闭区间 $[0,1]$ 内的图象。\n为此，每次相隔 $\\frac{1}{8}$ 列出它的数值表。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 210,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0217#6"
      ],
      "source_text": "我们作出这个函数在闭区间 $[0,1]$ 内的图象. 为此，每次相隔 $\\frac{1}{8}$ 列出它的数值表.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "因为 $10^{\\frac{1}{2}}=\\sqrt{10}\\approx3.162$，所以",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 210,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0217#7"
      ],
      "source_text": "因为 $10^{\\frac{1}{2}}=\\sqrt{10}\\approx3.162$，所以",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$10^{\\frac{1}{4}}=(10^{\\frac{1}{2}})^{\\frac{1}{2}}\\approx\\sqrt{3.162}\\approx1.779$，\n$10^{\\frac{1}{8}}=(10^{\\frac{1}{4}})^{\\frac{1}{2}}\\approx\\sqrt{1.779}\\approx1.333$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 210,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0217#8"
      ],
      "source_text": "$10^{\\frac{1}{4}}=(10^{\\frac{1}{2}})^{\\frac{1}{2}}\\approx\\sqrt{3.162}\\approx1.779$，$10^{\\frac{1}{8}}=(10^{\\frac{1}{4}})^{\\frac{1}{2}}\\approx\\sqrt{1.779}\\approx1.333$.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "现在我们来求式 $10^{\\frac{3}{8}}$ 的值。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 210,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0217#9"
      ],
      "source_text": "现在我们来求式 $10^{\\frac{3}{8}}$ 的值.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$10^{\\frac{3}{8}}=10^{\\frac{1}{4}+\\frac{1}{8}}=10^{\\frac{1}{4}}\\times10^{\\frac{1}{8}}\\approx1.779\\times1.333\\approx2.371$，等等。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 210,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0217#10"
      ],
      "source_text": "$10^{\\frac{3}{8}}=10^{\\frac{1}{4}+\\frac{1}{8}}=10^{\\frac{1}{4}}\\times10^{\\frac{1}{8}}\\approx1.779\\times1.333\\approx2.371$，等等.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们把所求出的式 $10^x$ 的值四舍五入到百分位后，列成下表：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 210,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0217#11"
      ],
      "source_text": "我们把所求出的式 $10^x$ 的值四舍五入到百分位后，列成下表：",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "tbl-p0217-01",
      "label": "表",
      "printed_page": 210,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0217#12"
