    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "由图可以看出，随着自变量 $x$ 值的增加，自变量的相等的改变量对应着函数的越来越大的改变量，也就是图象上点的排列变稀。\n因此，为了在区间 $[0,1]$ 内作出比较精确的函数 $y=10^x$ 的图象，最好对变量 $x$ 的某些中间数值算出式 $10^x$ 的值。\n我们把所求出的式 $10^x$ 的值四舍五入到百分位后，列成下表：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 212,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0219#1"
      ],
      "source_text": "由图可以看出，随着自变量 $x$ 值的增加，自变量的相等的改变量对应着函数的越来越大的改变量，也就是图象上点的排列变稀. 因此，为了在区间 $[0,1]$ 内作出比较精确的函数$y=10^x$ 的图象，最好对变量 $x$ 的某些中间数值算出式 $10^x$ 的值. 我们把所求出的式 $10^x$ 的值四舍五入到百分位后，列成下表：",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "tbl-p0219-01",
      "label": "表",
      "printed_page": 212,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0219#2"
      ],
      "source_text": "",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "在同一坐标系中，描出上表中给出坐标的点，并且用光滑曲线连结所有描出的点。\n图 82 中画出了函数 $y=10^x$ 对于 $x\\in[0,1]$ 时的图象。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 212,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0219#3"
      ],
      "source_text": "在同一坐标系中，描出上表中给出坐标的点，并且用光滑曲线连结所有描出的点. 图 82 中画出了函数 $y=10^x$ 对于 $x\\in[0,1]$ 时的图象.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "如果 $0\\leqslant x\\leqslant1$，利用作出的图象，可以求出式 $10^x$ 的值。\n例如，如果 $x=0.37$，那么 $10^x\\approx2.3$；\n如果 $x=0.82$，那么 $10^x\\approx6.6$(参看图 82)。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 212,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0219#4"
      ],
      "source_text": "如果 $0\\leqslant x\\leqslant1$，利用作出的图象，可以求出式 $10^x$ 的值. 例如，如果 $x=0.37$，那么 $10^x\\approx2.3$；如果 $x=0.82$，那么 $10^x\\approx6.6$(参看图 82).",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "知道式 $10^x$ 对于 $x\\in[0,1]$ 的值以后，容易算出这个式子对于任何 $x$ 的值。\n我们用例子来说明这一点。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 212,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0219#5"
      ],
      "source_text": "知道式 $10^x$ 对于 $x\\in[0,1]$ 的值以后，容易算出这个式子对于任何 $x$ 的值. 我们用例子来说明这一点.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "设需要求出式 $10^{2.58}$ 的近似值。\n我们把幂指数 2.58 写成它的整数部分与小数部分的和：\n$2.58=2+0.58$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 212,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0219#6"
      ],
      "source_text": "设需要求出式 $10^{2.58}$ 的近似值. 我们把幂指数 2.58 写成它的整数部分与小数部分的和：$2.58=2+0.58$.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "于是",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 212,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0219#7"
      ],
      "source_text": "于是",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$10^{2.58}=10^{2+0.58}=10^2\\times10^{0.58}$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 212,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0219#8"
      ],
      "source_text": "$10^{2.58}=10^{2+0.58}=10^2\\times10^{0.58}$.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "利用函数 $y=10^x$ 的图象求出式 $10^{0.58}$ 的值，得到：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 212,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0219#9"
      ],
      "source_text": "利用函数 $y=10^x$ 的图象求出式 $10^{0.58}$ 的值，得到：",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$10^{0.58}\\approx3.8$。\n因此 $10^{2.58}\\approx3.8\\times10^2$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 212,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0219#10"
      ],
      "source_text": "$10^{0.58}\\approx3.8$. 因此 $10^{2.58}\\approx3.8\\times10^2$.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们再来看一个例子。\n求表示式 $10^{-1.73}$ 的值。\n为此把负的幂指数 $-1.73$ 写成它的整数部分与小数部分的和：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 212,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0219#11",
        "p0220#3"
      ],
      "source_text": "我们再来看一个例子. 求表示式 $10^{-1.73}$ 的值. 为此把负的幂指数 $-1.73$ 写成它的整数部分与小数部分的和：",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-82",
      "label": "图 82",
      "printed_page": 213,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0220#1"
      ],
      "source_text": "",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图 82",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 82",
      "printed_page": 213,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0220#2"
      ],
      "source_text": "图 82",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$-1.73=-2+0.27$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 213,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0220#4"
      ],
      "source_text": "$-1.73=-2+0.27$.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "于是",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 213,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0220#5"
      ],
      "source_text": "于是",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$10^{-1.73}=10^{-2+0.27}=10^{-2}\\times10^{0.27}\\approx1.9\\times10^{-2}$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 213,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0220#6"
      ],
      "source_text": "$10^{-1.73}=10^{-2+0.27}=10^{-2}\\times10^{0.27}\\approx1.9\\times10^{-2}$.",
