            "p0219#4"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "知道式 $10^x$ 对于 $x\\in[0,1]$ 的值以后，容易算出这个式子对于任何 $x$ 的值. 我们用例子来说明这一点.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 212,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0219#5"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "设需要求出式 $10^{2.58}$ 的近似值. 我们把幂指数 2.58 写成它的整数部分与小数部分的和：$2.58=2+0.58$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 212,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0219#6"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "于是",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 212,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0219#7"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$10^{2.58}=10^{2+0.58}=10^2\\times10^{0.58}$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 212,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0219#8"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "利用函数 $y=10^x$ 的图象求出式 $10^{0.58}$ 的值，得到：",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 212,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0219#9"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$10^{0.58}\\approx3.8$. 因此 $10^{2.58}\\approx3.8\\times10^2$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 212,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0219#10"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "我们再来看一个例子. 求表示式 $10^{-1.73}$ 的值. 为此把负的幂指数 $-1.73$ 写成它的整数部分与小数部分的和：",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 212,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0219#11",
            "p0220#3"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "fig",
          "text": "",
          "id": "fig-82",
          "label": "图 82",
          "printed_page": 213,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0220#1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "cap",
          "text": "图 82",
